<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the German</p>
<p>first division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>22 - Ulf Kirsten (Bayer Leverkusen)</p>
<p>21 - Toni Polster (Cologne)</p>
<p>19 - Fredi Bobic (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>17 - Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe), Bernhard Winkler (1860 Munich),</p>
<p>Giovane Elber (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>16 - Paulo Sergio (Bayer Leverkusen)</p>
<p>14 - Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen), Juergen Klinsmann (Bayern</p>
<p>Munich), Jonathan Akpoborie (Hansa Rostock)</p>
<p>13 - Krasimir Balakov (VfB Stuttgart), Stefan Kuntz (Arminia</p>
<p>Bielefeld)</p>
</text>
